t-entangling-gates-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>“神经网络辅助的 ¹⁷¹Yb⁺ 量子磁力计”发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/neural-network-assisted-yb-quantum-magnetometer.html</link><description>将神经网络引入囚禁离子磁力计的数据处理，在散粒噪声与连续单次测量条件下提取射频场参数，成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 22 Dec 2022 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2022-12-22:/zh/neural-network-assisted-yb-quantum-magnetometer.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>“单冷原子的纳秒尺度超分辨成像”发表于 Physical Review Letters</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/super-resolved-imaging-single-cold-atom-nanosecond.html</link><description>将基态耗尽显微成像引入离子阱系统，实现单离子的二维超分辨成像与纳秒尺度频闪探测。成果发表于 Physical Review Letters。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 24 Dec 2021 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2021-12-24:/zh/super-resolved-imaging-single-cold-atom-nanosecond.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>利用离子量子比特的 Floquet 工程测量黎曼零点，成果发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/riemann-zeros-floquet-engineering-trapped-ion.html</link><description>通过周期驱动囚禁离子量子比特，利用 Floquet 动力学测量黎曼零点，连接量子物理与数论。成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jul 2021 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2021-07-01:/zh/riemann-zeros-floquet-engineering-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>绝热开放系统量子热力学的离子阱实验发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/quantum-thermodynamics-adiabatic-open-systems-trapped-ion.html</link><description>建立绝热开放系统中热、功、内能与熵的一般公式，利用离子阱实验研究量子绝热过程与热力学绝热过程的关系。成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2020 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2020-09-18:/zh/quantum-thermodynamics-adiabatic-open-systems-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>超越 Kibble–Zurek 机制的量子临界动力学实验发表于 Communications Physics</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/experimentally-testing-quantum-critical-dynamics-beyond-kibble-zurek.html</link><description>利用单个囚禁离子重建量子相变中拓扑缺陷的完整概率分布，检验超越平均缺陷数量的普适临界动力学。成果发表于 Communications Physics。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2020 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2020-02-14:/zh/experimentally-testing-quantum-critical-dynamics-beyond-kibble-zurek.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>抑制残余几何退相干的实验成果发表于 Science Bulletin</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/experimental-demonstration-suppressing-residual-geometric-dephasing.html</link><description>在单个囚禁离子上验证改进的动力学解耦序列，抑制传统自旋回波与 CPMG 序列中的残余几何退相干。成果发表于 Science Bulletin。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2019 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2019-09-20:/zh/experimental-demonstration-suppressing-residual-geometric-dephasing.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>艾铭忠</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/Members/Ming-Zhong_Ai.html</link><description>&lt;h2 id="联系方式"&gt;联系方式&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;地址：安徽省合肥市金寨路 96
